+        // fix_safe_area_scan_requires_matching_rule.py. A rule
+        // targeting an element the page does not have previously
+        // counted the same as one in active use, which is why Google
+        // reported YES while visibly not needing the reserved strip.
+        //
+        // Rules with no selectorText - @media, @supports and other
